		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A spring-loaded ram that smashes and shoves enemies back.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions.</strong> Reach 2, Damage: STRd8 Force. On hit: Large and smaller targets are pushed 2 spaces away.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Target is Dazed, 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on saves to avoid being moved against your will.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Surprise Battering Ram gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Surprise Battering Ram (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Passive: Offers advantage on saves to avoid being moved against your will (tick it in the save dialog).</em></p>",
